    {
      "text": "I will give thee tables of stone, Ex. 24:12. Thou shalt also make a table of shittim wood, Ex. 25:23 (37:10). gave unto Moses … two tables of testimony, tables of stone, Ex. 31:18 (Deut. 9:10). he cast the tables out of his hands, Ex. 32:19. Hew thee two tables of stone, Ex. 34:1 (Deut. 10:1). set them … upon the pure table before the Lord, Lev. 24:6. to receive the tables of stone, Deut. 9:9. nothing in the ark save the two tables of stone, 1 Kgs. 8:9. Thou preparest a table before me, Ps. 23:5. table become a snare before them, Ps. 69:22 (Rom. 11:9). Can God furnish a table in the wilderness, Ps. 78:19. write them upon the table of thine heart, Prov. 3:3. all tables are full of vomit and filthiness, Isa. 28:8. sin of Judah … is graven upon the table of their heart, Jer. 17:1. This is the table that is before the Lord, Ezek. 41:22. table of the Lord is polluted, Mal. 1:12.",
