      "text": "Jesus … overthrew the tables of the moneychangers, Matt. 21:12 (Mark 11:15; John 2:15). he asked for a writing table, Luke 1:63. hand of him that betrayeth me is with me on the table, Luke 22:21. ye may eat and drink at my table, Luke 22:30. not reason that we should … serve tables, Acts 6:2. ye cannot be partakers of the Lord’s table, and of the table of devils, 1 Cor. 10:21. not in tables of stone, but in fleshy tables of the heart, 2 Cor. 3:3. Aaron’s rod that budded, and the tables of the covenant, Heb. 9:4.",
